From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cataclysm-ios <cataclysm-ios@localhost>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 23:05:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Create the config directory before opening the debug log

The debug log is written to config/debug.log, but on a fresh install
the config directory is only created after logging starts, so the
first session's log was silently lost.
---
 src/main.cpp | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/main.cpp b/src/main.cpp
index 0ad8731..a8de5c3 100644
--- a/src/main.cpp
+++ b/src/main.cpp
@@ -716,6 +716,9 @@ int main( int argc, const char *argv[] )
                 PATH_INFO::user_dir().c_str() );
         exit( 1 );
     }
+    // The debug log lives in the config directory; on a fresh install it does
+    // not exist yet, and the log would silently go nowhere.
+    assure_dir_exist( PATH_INFO::config_dir() );
 
 #if defined(EMSCRIPTEN)
     setupDebug( DebugOutput::std_err );
